<view class="page"><image class="page-backdrop" src="cloud://cloud1-d7gketoi570d17f80.636c-cloud1-d7gketoi570d17f80-1524135194/media-v1/assets__spring-lake.webp" mode="aspectFill" aria-hidden="true"/><view class="title">分享这一场好球</view><view class="sub">有些时光，不必用成绩衡量。</view><view class="choices"><view wx:for="{{themes}}" wx:key="id" class="choice {{index===index2?'active':''}}" wx:for-index="index2" data-i="{{index2}}" bindtap="theme">{{item.name}}</view></view><view class="row card"><text>附上我的成绩</text><switch checked="{{showScore}}" color="#226448" bindchange="toggle"/></view><view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="note">正在把这一刻，留在风景里…</view><image wx:if="{{path}}" class="postcard-preview" src="{{path}}" mode="widthFix" bindtap="preview"/><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="danger">{{error}}</view><view class="toolbar"><button bindtap="save" disabled="{{!path}}">保存图片</button><button class="primary" open-type="share">邀请朋友，一起去走走</button></view><view class="note spaced">点开图片可全屏查看并长按保存。只分享你自己的成绩，不包含同组球友的记录。</view><canvas type="2d" id="postcard" class="postcard-canvas"/></view><privacy-panel/>
